      <title>Viva Aerobus Announces Nonstop Service to Monterrey, Mexico</title>
      <link>https://www.therepubliq.com/travel/airlines/viva-aerobus-nonstop-austin-monterrey-mexico/</link>
      <description>Mexico’s ultra-low-cost carrier, Viva Aerobus, announced its arrival to Austin by launching nonstop flights to Monterrey, Mexico. Starting on March 22, 2024, this year-round service will operate four days per week. Viva Aerobus now joins Austin-Bergstrom International Airport as Central Texas’ 22nd airline and eighth international airline. “I’m thrilled to welcome Viva Aerobus to Austin […]</description>
